# Normalise line endings in the repository, not in the working tree.
#
# The project is edited on Windows (PowerShell, Visual Studio, Rider) and read on Linux runners,
# so objects are stored with LF and checked out with LF everywhere. Without this, a single edit
# saved by a Windows editor turns a whole file into a "changed" diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled and binary artefacts: never diff, never convert.
*.ico binary
*.msi binary
*.dll binary
*.wixpdb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
